    "title": "AeroCargo Practice API",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Local learning backend. No authentication. Sample quotations only. Gross mode means total weight per row. Piece mode means weight per piece. Weight totals gross/volume/charge are lb; kg is chargeable kg. Imports return partial data, not a validated shipment. Implemented with Python standard library."
  },
